            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Viātōrēs in stabulō pernoctant, quod caupōna plēna est. The travellers spend the night in the stable, because the inn is full."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "pernoctō, pernoctāre, pernoctāvī, pernoctātum. From per 'through' and nox 'night'."
            }
